OL,3,ACommittee calls for bill to address AI
OL,4,Athreat to human rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, the head of the US AI
OL,7,Fcompany Anthropic, Dario Amodei,
OL,8,Fproposed a plan that includes global
OL,9,Fregulation, industry-wide regulation
OL,10,Fand independent monitoring of AI models
OL,11,Fas they are developed.
